[38;5;252m[1m## Two harness defects that were masking it[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Both had to be fixed before the bug became visible, and both are the kind that make a suite silently vacuous:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
1. [1mStale artifact.[22m The crate is [38;5;10mcrate-type = ["cdylib"][0m only, so [38;5;10mcargo test[0m never builds [38;5;10mlibdriver.so[0m at all — the tests were loading a leftover [38;5;10mtarget/release[0m copy. A deliberate endianness break still passed. The harness now builds the cdylib itself into a private target dir and takes the path from cargo's own [38;5;10mcompiler-artifact[0m JSON.[0m[0m
2. [1mlibtest polluting the capture.[22m [38;5;10mdriver[0m communicates only through libc [38;5;10mstdout[0m, so the harness redirects fd 1. libtest writes its own [38;5;10mtest NAME ... ok[0m progress lines to that same fd from other threads, which landed [3minside[23m captures. The test now runs under [38;5;10mharness = false[0m with a sequential runner that reports on stderr.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
